PART 3: PROMPT DISCIPLINE CHEATSHEET
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PERMITTED PROMPTS:
• Summarize: "Read spec.md only. Summarize rules as a checklist, list ambiguities. No code."
• Map: "Point me to the functions for X, Y, Z. Symbol name + 1 line. Don't edit files."
• Challenge: "List up to 4 likely contract violations of these rules, with the smallest
  input that exposes each. Don't patch."
• Test Scaffolding: "Given Account(balance_cents=10000) and Order(cost_cents=10000),
  scaffold a pytest test asserting InsufficientFundsError is NOT raised."
• Diff Review: "Review this diff against the contract. Call out assumptions and what
  tests still don't prove."

DISQUALIFYING PROMPTS:
✗ "Find the bugs in this repository."
✗ "Fix this function." / "Rewrite this class to make tests pass."
✗ "Solve ticket POT-102."
✗ Letting the AI choose an interpretation for an ambiguity without you deciding.


